{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方於屯門順豐圍截獲一輛私家車，在車廂內檢獲13個懷疑假車牌，並拘捕一名姓陳（47歲）目標男子。消息稱，上周六（14日）凌晨1時許，新界北總區交通部警員巡經上址時，發現一輛可疑私家車停在路邊，上前截查之際，該車司機開車逃去。</p><p>警方經情報分折追查後，今日（20日）上午10時左右，在順豐圍截獲涉案銀灰色豐田私家車，在車廂內檢獲約13個懷疑假車牌；並以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」拘捕涉案男子，他被黑布蒙頭、押解在場調查。現場未有搜出其他違禁品，車輛稍後拖走檢驗；案件由屯門警區重案組跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在車尾箱檢獲13個假車牌。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200421937013198848729408.jpeg/TgMWgInRtE85s8zXRRfZdm6CcSOT4SVn7OMDn-zjA58\"/><figcaption>警方在車尾箱檢獲13個假車牌。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方押解疑犯。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200421934018334720042539.jpeg/-MzQM90b59LAUEBxIxDETPB-88R_b6ZvlNd0LZTXdC0\"/><figcaption>警方押解疑犯。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方檢走一袋證物。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200424100418293760075469.jpeg/cnvso865WqYlPfQB_eUqmgRZBBueNOH67jnw-u458Po\"/><figcaption>警方檢走一袋證物。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方押走疑犯調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200424103421546496653801.jpeg/IX2IMxxn_mCiqYsVEKHMy8RBZ83zUPNq-Fr0Dfha9A0\"/><figcaption>警方押走疑犯調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在順豐圍採取行動。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200424106097643520435867.jpeg/Nqb64yiXZr8rJo2fNevnW5QzDyIbbhTw_HNRxfxzUcU\"/><figcaption>警方在順豐圍採取行動。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在順豐圍採取行動。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200433195275784192947185.jpeg/rx6hTXbVjG_s0Au_hDvtUL7A0II-mg4gdk_iFHZP4hQ\"/><figcaption>警方在順豐圍採取行動。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:02.118913+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:32:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:42.753100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:35.872120+00:00","content_hash":"ae1876c34da9373abc050ddcee1a5634bcf4167c60d87d40ce51bf0fbbb024a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}